Over the next few months we have the beautiful Yayoi Morris teaching the open dance class on Tuesdays at 6.30pm. For those of you that don't know Yayoi, she has trained in West Africa and has been dancing and performing with Bec for a long time. Yayoi is a very generous and patient teacher and her style is absolutely beautiful. We are super excited to have Yayoi on board and we know you will enjoy her funky fast paced choreography. Here are the upcoming dates over the next few months. As a first time student you can still grab the $50 deal ($55 online) for a 4 week course [here](/product/come-and-play-4-class-pass-special-offer/).

**Upcoming Term Dates for Drum & Dance Classes**

**Dates: Tuesdays 28th Jan- 31st March**

5.30pm - Open Drumming Class - Nathaniel Combs

6.30pm Open Dancing Class - Yayoi Morris

7.30pm Experienced Drummers Class - Nathaniel Combs

**Dates: Tuesdays 5th May- 23rd June**

5.30pm - Open Drumming Class - Nathaniel Combs

6.30pm Open Dancing Class - Yayoi Morris

7.30pm Experienced Drummers Class - Nathaniel Combs

**Dates: Tuesdays 14 July - 15th Sep**

5.30pm - Open Drumming Class - Nathaniel Combs

6.30pm Open Dancing Class - Bec Combs

7.30pm Experienced Drummers Class - Nathaniel Combs

_Note: Foli Kan Experienced Dance Class will resume this term with training for a local community performance._
